      "content": "Frame the current solid setup not as a finished product, but as a highly optimized baseline that benefits most from proactive, future-proofing measures. Instead of focusing on *gaps*, highlight how Advanced Continuous Monitoring acts as an *insurance policy* against evolving, zero-day threats they haven't even imagined yet. Emphasize that the upgrade shifts their security posture from reactive detection to predictive risk elimination, offering unparalleled assurance.",
