    "summary": "The user, acting as a salesperson, is seeking advice on how to overcome a successful audit report to sell an \"Advanced Continuous Monitoring\" upgrade. The assistant provides strategic advice on how to pivot the conversation from existing strengths to theoretical future risks and operational blind spots to secure the contract.",
